{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nrWHVdRr1z1793013934.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>北愛爾蘭桌球公開賽，加蘭威爾遜決賽大勝積鍾斯，打破超過一年錦標荒奪冠。</p><p></p><p>17局9勝下，威爾遜打完首節領先7-1，對手積鍾斯在第11局早段，打失黑球，再無機會埋枱，威爾遜把握機會，打出一桿75度。港將張家瑋都有參加，他在首圈擊敗奧蘇利雲，32強贏冰咸，16強止步。</p><p></p><p>世界第九的威爾遜，決賽三次一桿破百，這位英格蘭球手，局數大勝9-2，第二次贏得北愛公開賽冠軍，亦結束19個月的排名賽錦標荒。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:31.743510+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T20:18:17.430107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:10.244487+00:00","content_hash":"2a9965f4a3955b18e86722b6ec6dbb2ebb60aa231e758939d796ab6f2a3f5f09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}